{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview\/initwithreuseidentifier:"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","title":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"MLNAnnotationView.h","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNAnnotationView.h#L77"},"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNAnnotationView(im)initWithReuseIdentifier:","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reuseIdentifier","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A unique string identifier for this view that allows you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to reuse this view with multiple similar annotations. You can set this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" if you don’t intend to reuse the view, but it is a good"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"idea in general to specify a reuse identifier to avoid creating redundant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"views."}]}],"name":"reuseIdentifier"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The initialized annotation view object."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The reuse identifier provides a way for you to improve performance by recycling","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"annotation views as they enter and leave the map’s viewport. As an annotation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaves the viewport, the map view moves its associated view to a reuse queue.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When a new annotation becomes visible, you can request a view for that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"annotation by passing the appropriate reuse identifier string to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","isActive":true},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Initializes and returns a new annotation view object.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/initWithReuseIdentifier:"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotationView/initWithReuseIdentifier:":{"title":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview\/initwithreuseidentifier:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Initializes and returns a new annotation view object.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/initWithReuseIdentifier:","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotationView":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" class is responsible for marking a point annotation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a view. Annotation views represent an annotation object, which is an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object that corresponds to the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol. When an annotation’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"geographic coordinate is visible in the map view, the map view asks its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegate to a corresponding annotation view. If an annotation view is created","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a reuse identifier, the map view may recycle the view when it goes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offscreen.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNAnnotationView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView","type":"topic","title":"MLNAnnotationView"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:":{"kind":"symbol","title":"dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a reusable annotation view object associated with its identifier.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/dequeuereusableannotationviewwithidentifier:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotation":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol is used to provide annotation-related information","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to a map view. To use this protocol, you adopt it in any custom objects that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store or represent annotation data. Each object then serves as the source of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"objects to handle the display.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNAnnotation","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotation","title":"MLNAnnotation"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","role":"collection","title":"MapLibre"}}}